  "question_stem": "A particle $P$ moves in a straight line, starting from rest at a point $O$ on the line. At time $t$ s after leaving $O$ the acceleration of $P$ is $k(16 - t^2) \\mathrm{m s^{-2}}$, where $k$ is a positive constant, and the displacement from $O$ is $s$ m. The velocity of $P$ is $8 \\mathrm{m s^{-1}}$ when $t = 4$.",
  "context_texts": [
    "$k=3/16$ and $s=\\dfrac{1}{64}t^2(96-t^2)$",
    "$s=\\dfrac{1}{64}t^2(96-t^2)$."
